{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>The Story!</u> <br> Once upon a time, in a digital world, far, far, far so very far away.\u00a0 <br>There was a Town, Called Town Square, Now despite it's name Town Square is inhabited by many strange\u00a0\u00a0unquiet individuals! Circle, Squares, rectangles, shovels, trees, etc. <br>Then, due to a unknown error,\u00a0 <strong><u>T</u></strong>hE GL<i>IT</i>CH Z<strong>O</strong>Ne appeared!\u00a0 Converting all of the town and it's residents!\u00a0 <br>Only one place was spared, MR Squares homes! So take on the unquiet trial and error Puzzles, save your Towns people and restore Town Square back to it's former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/9a75c258143db22a7e05085eda9515d1.avif?t=1754085894\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Trial and Error levels!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Bonus and 2 extra levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable Housing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ outfits to unlock and wear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Glitch Zone Levels!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lively Town Hub with fun NPC\u2019s to interact with!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find pets and let them accompany you on your journey!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose and create your own party of followers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Game pass!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No 50Gig updates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Blood donations required to play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848430/extras/c3aaed6f2870bc3fd3501438183770b0.avif?t=1754085894\" /></div></p><p cl